    "Establish clear Turnaround Time SLAs with your production contractors. Scriptwriters must deliver approved drafts within twenty-four hours of topic assignment; video editors must deliver rough cuts within forty-eight hours of asset ingestion; and sound designers must complete final mixing within twelve hours. Locking in predictable temporal cadence ensures that your assembly line produces a consistent output of three to five finished videos per day across your channel portfolio.",
