    "Reinvest surplus ad revenue into launching subsequent channel properties across complementary niches. When Channel One generates fifteen hundred dollars in net profit after covering its own editing costs, use that fifteen hundred dollars to fund the initial thirty-day production run of Channel Two. By compounding platform ad payouts into asset expansion, you build an automated multi-channel holding company that expands without outside debt or venture capital.",
